<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Venomgrip</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

Venom-laced chitin hardens across the knuckles, strengthening the
wearer's grip.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Recipe ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 22)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Target:</ansi>      gloves (must be equipped)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chrysalis setting (x2), mutation catalyst (x1),
                binding paste (x1)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Time:</ansi>        5 rounds
  <ansi fg="yellow">Reserve:</ansi>     stamina (1% at tier 0, scaling with tier)

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Effect ━━━</ansi>

Increases strength.

The enchantment grows stronger through combat use, advancing
through five tiers of increasing power and reserve cost.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help enchanting</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
